flowchart TD
    A[File uploaded to AI system] --> B{Only parsed, no ingestion?}
    B -->|Yes| B1[Log and release: no further action]
    B -->|No| C{Ingested into RAG or KB?}
    C -->|Yes| C1[Purge from vector store, reindex]
    C -->|No| D{Model followed embedded instructions?}
    D -->|Yes| D1[Isolate session, review outputs]
    D -->|No| E{Agent invoked a tool?}
    E -->|Yes| E1[Revoke tool tokens, audit actions]
    E -->|No| F{Sensitive data revealed?}
    F -->|Yes| F1[Notify DPO, start disclosure review]
    F -->|No| G{Code executed or external call made?}
    G -->|Yes| G1[Isolate host, block network egress]
    G -->|No| H[Close as benign, continue monitoring]
